(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-84","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["返程前，程雾把[[necklace|项链]]从伤指旁移开，修背包用的[[needle|针]]留在旅馆。再拖一晚是[[needless|不必要的]]耽搁，车站[[neighborhood|附近]]的[[neighbour|邻居]]替文员接走孩子。旧教具[[neuron|神经元]]图与[[neutron|中子]]图已经[[newly|重新]]分封，拆分的[[nineteen|十九]]条记录有一条空栏，是原主壳，不是新出现一只箱。我没把这样的差错写成惊人谜团。叶澄签上更正经过，没有因为那一栏不是新货就说前面的错误都无关紧要。站方按同一表与实物清点，所留部分终于不必由我们一个人的眼睛一直盯住。","基金喜欢[[noble|高尚的]]保证，我如今更信一个实际的[[nod|点头]]。[[noisy|嘈杂的]]站道里，恢复供给的[[normalization|常态化]]交给学校与接收单位。列车先走[[northeast|东北]]方向，接入[[northern|北方的]]干线，地图箭头向[[northward|北]]，司机说车再向[[northwards|北方]]绕行，之后沿[[northwest|西北]]支路回临河。这不是大家随口说顺口的方向，我们用实际到站核每一段。[[noted|著名的]]捐赠人姓名不能把未知变成[[nought|零]]，宣言里的[[noun|名词]]‘援助’也不是永远正确的目的地。程雾收起路线图，让导航只负责带人回去，不替货签解释安全。","这不该写成没人付代价的[[novel|小说]]。[[nowadays|如今]]受助点的[[nun|修女]]替我们确认[[nutrient|营养物资]]接续，杜医生依然[[obstinate|执拗]]地追完整病册。危险[[obviously|明显地]]不能仅凭供给真有用就消失，[[occasionally|偶尔]]出错的说辞也无法遮去反复改签。[[oceania|大洋洲]]来源的旧标签由[[officer|公务人员]]封存，维修单以[[ohm|欧姆]]记录线路，外壳[[oil|油]]迹则分别取样。我们不再带全套原件跑来跑去，获准工作影像足够随身，真正的纸各有接收人。此时的安稳来自许多人一起记下去向，而不是三个人终于变得能保护所有东西。","老陈把袋放[[onto|到…之上]]行李架，我们[[onward|向前]]去，再[[onwards|往前]]经过旧桥。桥边能[[operate|运转]]的正常工厂没有停，校史[[opium|鸦片]]贸易旧展也仍可讲，[[opposite|对面的]]货道却留着对应箱。运输的[[optimal|最佳的]]时刻不只是利润最大，[[ordinarily|通常]]一辆[[ordinary|普通的]]车也应等真正可用的水位。车窗[[ornamental|装饰性的]]花纹划过乡村，司机说[[otherwise|否则]]早就赶到。老陈没有催他冒险，开始给港务讲平台旧系泊点，不动控制设备，只提供自己亲手修过的那一段。这一次他愿意让别人把话听完再决定，而不是用年资替代现场判断。","临河的[[outdoor|露天的]]装卸场已有人在[[outdoors|户外]]核车，城[[outskirt|边缘]]的河风向[[outwards|外]]吹。基金尾单的[[overdue|过期的]]许可不获通过，码头[[overhang|悬垂部分]]不能承受[[overload|超载]]。港务正式留下两只尾盒，整条已知批次在不同站点都获得对应保管。但办公室仍安排清运队转出平台上的旧备用箱，借口它们不在我们的尾号里。老陈听完警告就坐直：旧箱可能还装着工程件，要先核载荷，不是只要没出现在这张表就随时可搬。何警官让现场人员清点所有与该转运令相关的实物，最后一处缺口不再只靠我们辨标签。","车到临河时天色已晚，母亲在站外等，拿着三份热饭，没有把我抱得喘不过气，只说瘦了。程雾把受伤的手藏了一下，母亲却把她的包轻轻接过，老陈也没坚持不累。我们在亮处吃完饭再去港口；何警官告诉我，最后清运定在今晚潮前，基金贺青本人正到场交接。关于我父亲的展板仍保持已更正的内容，新的水位和新的货却需要今日的人负责。我把旧船票留在母亲袋里，告诉她这次去的是工作的旧港，不是求一个死去的人来帮忙。第七码头的潮声又响起来，我们终于回到了能看见下一次决定的地方。"],"en":["Before returning, Cheng moved a [[necklace|necklace]] from her injured finger and left a repair [[needle|needle]] at the hotel. Another night's delay was [[needless|needless]]. A [[neighborhood|neighborhood]] [[neighbour|neighbour]] collected the clerk's child. [[neuron|Neuron]] and [[neutron|neutron]] teaching materials were [[newly|newly]] packed separately. [[nineteen|Nineteen]] splitting entries included a blank for the original casing, no mysterious extra box. Ye documented correction without treating that fact as erasure of other errors. Station workers matched objects and sheets; we no longer needed to watch every retained item personally.","I trusted a real [[nod|nod]] more than [[noble|noble]] assurances. Amid [[noisy|noisy]] lanes, supply [[normalization|normalization]] passed to school and receiving services. We travelled [[northeast|northeast]] onto a [[northern|northern]] trunk. Arrows pointed [[northward|northward]]; the driver described going [[northwards|northwards]] then taking the [[northwest|northwest]] branch toward Linhe. We checked actual stations rather than convenient directions. A [[noted|noted]] donor could not reduce unknowns to [[nought|nought]]. The [[noun|noun]] 'aid' supplied no eternally correct destination. Cheng let navigation bring people home without using it to certify cargo.","This was no costless [[novel|novel]]. [[nowadays|Nowadays]] a receiving [[nun|nun]] confirmed [[nutrient|nutrient]] supplies while [[obstinate|obstinate]] Du continued clinical records. Benefits could not [[obviously|obviously]] erase danger; repeated labels defeated [[occasionally|occasionally]] mistaken explanations. An [[oceania|Oceania]] label was sealed by an [[officer|officer]]. [[ohm|Ohm]] readings and outer [[oil|oil]] traces remained separate. Originals no longer travelled casually with us; authorized images were enough. Stability came from many recipients recording custody together, not three investigators becoming able to protect every object themselves.","Chen placed bags [[onto|onto]] a rack. We travelled [[onward|onward]], then [[onwards|onwards]] past the bridge. Normal factories could [[operate|operate]]; the school [[opium|opium]] trade exhibit remained teachable while identified cargo waited [[opposite|opposite]]. An [[optimal|optimal]] time considered water, not profit alone. [[ordinarily|Ordinarily]] an [[ordinary|ordinary]] vehicle should await usable levels. [[ornamental|Ornamental]] window patterns crossed villages. The driver said we would have arrived [[otherwise|otherwise]]. Chen urged no risk, explaining repaired mooring points to port staff without taking controls or making seniority replace current assessment.","Workers checked vehicles in an [[outdoor|outdoor]] yard [[outdoors|outdoors]]. River wind on the [[outskirt|outskirt]] blew [[outwards|outwards]]. An [[overdue|overdue]] permit failed, and the platform [[overhang|overhang]] could not bear [[overload|overload]]. Both final boxes were retained, completing known batch custody. Yet office orders would remove old reserve containers from the platform, claiming absence from our suffix sheet. Chen requested load checks: no number match meant no automatic permission. He arranged inventory of every object under the same transfer order, so the final gap no longer depended solely on our label recognition.","Mother met us at the station with three hot meals. She noticed Cheng's hidden hand and took her bag; Chen admitted fatigue. We ate in light before going to the port. He said the last clearance was scheduled before tonight's tide, with He Qing arriving personally. My father's corrected display remained. Today's cargo and water required today's responsibility. I left the old ticket with Mother. We were visiting a working port, not asking the dead for help. Number Seven's tide sounded again; we had reached a place where the next choice could be seen."]});
